"#232", "widgets_values": ["制作一支 5 秒、16:9 横版电影级生活方式短片。场景与光影严格参考图3（阳光公园红色塑胶跑道）；男主角外貌穿搭严格参考图1；女主角外貌穿搭严格参考图2。保持两人身份特征高度一致。\n镜头描述： 中景侧面跟拍。清晨阳光下，男女主角在图3的红色跑道上并肩慢跑，步伐轻盈同步。男主角（参考图1）身穿米色T恤和牛仔裤，神情放松；女主角（参考图2）身穿白色吊带和牛仔裤，波浪长发随跑步节奏自然飘动，金色首饰在阳光下微闪。两人相视一笑，眼神交流自然亲密。背景是虚化的绿树和蓝天，浅景深突出人物。\n视觉风格： Photorealistic 真人实拍质感，35mm 电影镜头，自然光照明，色彩清新明亮，带轻微胶片颗粒感。禁止动画风格或过度磨皮。\n音频设计： rhythmic 的脚步声踩在塑胶跑道上，轻柔鸟鸣与树叶沙沙声作为环境底噪，搭配轻快温暖的 acoustic guitar 短旋律，节奏与跑步步伐同步。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [370, 390], "pos": [-1483.1470947265625, 6007.86767578125], "id": 138, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 16}, {"showAdvanced": false, "outputs": [{"name": "width", "links": [276], "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "links": [277], "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["16:9 (Widescreen)", 0.6000000000000001, 32], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "aspect_ratio"}, "name": "aspect_ratio", "label": "aspect_ratio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspect_ratio"}, {"widget": {"name": "megapixels"}, "name": "megapixels", "label": "megapixels", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "megapixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "multiple"}, "name": "multiple", "label": "multiple", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "multiple"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ResolutionSelector", "title": "Resolution Selector (Size) Aspect Ratio:", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [336.4831848144531, 175.01751708984375], "pos": [-1492.5439453125, 5618.78076171875], "id": 115, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0